        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana KC20, Solid Brass 3/4\" Retro Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis beautiful cabinet knob is decorative as well as functional. Each cabinet knob includes a screw for easy installation. The Solid Brass 3/4 Inch Retro Cabinet Knob is reminiscent of 50's and 60's decor and will bring the retro look to any cabinet door, furniture piece, or cabinet drawer. Solid brass construction will look great even after years of use. Available in 9 different finish colors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-KC20-Specifications.gif?v=1704354521\" width=\"290\" height=\"179\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana KC20 Cabinet Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/3-4-inch-satin-stainless-steel-retro-cabinet-knob-deltana-kc20u32d\"><b>Stainless Steel  Retro Cabinet Knob</b></a> and a larger <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-1-inch-retro-cabinet-knob-deltana-kc24\"><b>1\" Retro Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana KC20 Retro Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<!-- <li>Diameter at Base: 1/2\"</li> -->\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/KC20.pdf?v=1704262158\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana KC20 Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose, the handle will still be <b>high quality solid brass</b>.\r\n</p>",
