                "title": "Solid Brass 3/4 Inch Retro Cabinet Knob | Deltana KC20",
                "description": "Solid Brass 3/4 Inch Retro Cabinet Knob Deltana KC20 - This beautiful cabinet knob is decorative as well as functional. Each cabinet knob includes a screw for easy installation. The Solid Brass 3/4 Inch Retro Cabinet Knob is reminiscent of 50's and 60's decor and will bring the retro look to any cabinet door, furniture piece, or cabinet drawer. Solid brass construction will look great even after years of use. Available in 9 different finish colors. \r\n",
